@startuml
title SIC/XE Simulator - Frontend Architecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Next.js Frontend" {
  [Project Pages]
  [Editor Route /editor?project=...]
  [TopBar]
  [StatusBar]
  [FileExplorer]
  [CodeEditor / Monaco]
  [ExecutionView]
  [RegisterTable]
  [MemoryTable]
  [Console]

  component "Simulator Client" as Client
  component "WebTransport" as Transport
}

[Project Pages] --> Client
[Editor Route /editor?project=...] --> [TopBar]
[Editor Route /editor?project=...] --> [FileExplorer]
[Editor Route /editor?project=...] --> [CodeEditor / Monaco]
[Editor Route /editor?project=...] --> [ExecutionView]
[Editor Route /editor?project=...] --> [StatusBar]

[ExecutionView] --> [RegisterTable]
[ExecutionView] --> [MemoryTable]
[ExecutionView] --> [Console]

[TopBar] --> Client
[FileExplorer] --> Client
[CodeEditor / Monaco] --> Client
[ExecutionView] --> Client

Client --> Transport
Transport --> "Backend /ws"

note right of Client
Public simulator operations include:
step()
reset()
clear()
architectures()
loadProject(sessionId, projectId)
loadFile()
end note

database "Browser project storage" as LocalProjects
cloud "Session project API" as SessionApi
[Project Pages] --> LocalProjects : read / create
[FileExplorer] --> LocalProjects : persist mutations
LocalProjects --> SessionApi : sync project set on start
SessionApi --> Transport : load by session and project UUID

@enduml
